ems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Regeneration 25 (Deactivated By Fire)","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Regeneration]</p>"},"rules":[{"deactivatedBy":["fire"],"key":"FastHealing","type":"regeneration","value":25}],"slug":"regeneration","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":true,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689046068920,"modifiedTime":1689046081419,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.lR9R5Vld8Eu2Dha5","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"9EYyes2Ui7wIrU10"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Adhesive Webbing","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>Any creature that Strikes the silkwurm with a melee weapon must attempt a @Check[type:reflex|dc:29] save. On a failure, the creature is disarmed of its weapon, which becomes stuck to the silkwurm's body; if the Strike was an unarmed attack, the creature's limb sticks to the silkwurm's body and the creature becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Immobilized]{Immobilized}. A creature must succeed at a @Check[type:athletics|dc:24] check to retrieve a stuck weapon. On a failure, the creature takes @Damage[2d6[piercing]] damage and the weapon remains stuck, and on a critical failure, the creature also becomes stuck to the silkwurm and becomes immobilized. A stuck creature takes [[/r 2d6[piercing]]] damage each round at the end of its turn if it remains stuck to the silkwurm, and it can use an @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.Escape]{Escape} action to try to free itself from the construct, with an Escape DC of 24.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"TmNBrmPF6p6WIN2r","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.3.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689046104520,"modifiedTime":1691261012576,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Nest Defense","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The silkwurm takes slashing damage from an adjacent creature or takes a critical hit from an adjacent creature.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The spiders within the silkwurm sense a major intrusion and swarm to fend off the invaders. The triggering creature must attempt a @Check[type:reflex|dc:30] save. On a failure, the creature takes @Damage[6d6[piercing]] damage and becomes @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 1} (@Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Frightened]{Frightened 2} on a critical failure) as a legion of spiders leap onto the attacker.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actio